  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0CRZ">Lemma <span data-tag="0CRZ">110.47.2</span>.</a> There exists an affine scheme $X = \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A)$ whose underlying topological space is Noetherian and an injective $A$-module $I$ such that $\widetilde{I}$ has nonvanishing $H^1$ on some quasi-compact open $U$ of $X$. </p>
